  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multiprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder outperform those with pca_n2000 (0.6501 vs 0.5907 accuracy). This experiment tests scvi_n200 in singleprofile setting to determine if the encoder's benefit is consistent across profile configurations. It isolates the effect of encoder choice while keeping profile setting simple, addressing uncertainty about whether scvi_n200's performance gain is profile-agnostic. This clarifies the relative importance of encoder vs profile setting, guiding future decisions on optimal RNA-only configurations."
}

